{
  "item": "Storage01",
  "mu_name": "Storage01",
  "mu_name_from": "NPC/Storage01.bmd \u2014 the Safety Guardian, and in LEGACY's own spawn table 'Baz The Vault Keeper'. Type 240, standing at two places in Lorencia.",
  "world": "lorencia",
  "object_type": -1,
  "why_this_one": "The last of the single-file NPCs, and the largest by a distance: 1512 triangles across fourteen sheets, where the smith is 730 across five. He comes with his vault \u2014 the chest is part of the same .bmd, the way the smith's anvil is \u2014 which is where most of that goes.\n\nFourteen sheets on one figure is worth noting rather than tidying. MU dresses him out of the same wardrobe it dresses players from: upper_12 and lower_12 and boots_12 are an armour set, head_02 and head_07 are faces from two others. Nothing here is bespoke, which is why a townsperson costs so little in a game that already has armour.",
  "profile": "npc",
